OL,3,AUS death row inmate Christa Pike taken
OL,4,Ato hospital after surviving two lethal
OL,5,Ainjections, says lawyer
OL,6,
OL,7,FTennessee death row inmate Christa Pike
OL,8,Fhas been taken to hospital after her
OL,9,Fheart was still beating following two
OL,10,Flethal injections during her execution,
OL,11,Fher lawyer says.
OL,13,FHer legal team filed an emergency
OL,14,Fmotion to halt the convicted murderer's
OL,15,Fexecution as it was happening, saying:
OL,16,F"Ms Pike has lost consciousness and
OL,17,Fstill has a heartbeat and is audibly
OL,18,Fsnoring."
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
