OL,3,AUS death row inmate Christa Pike taken
OL,4,Ato hospital after surviving two lethal
OL,5,Ainjections, says lawyer
OL,6,
OL,7,FOne of her attorneys told the BBC that
OL,8,FPike, 50, was "being provided
OL,9,Flife-saving measures" in hospital after
OL,10,Ftwo syringes of pentobarbital had been
OL,11,Fadministered.
OL,13,FPike was sentenced to death in 1996 for
OL,14,Fthe murder of 19-year-old Colleen
OL,15,FSlemmer.
